date-released: "2025-09-14"

url: "https://icarda.github.io/QBMS/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/icarda/QBMS"

license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"

abstract: >-
  QBMS is an R package that assists breeders in linking breeding data
  management systems with analytical pipelines. It supports querying and
  retrieving phenotypic and genotypic data from systems including EBS, BMS,
  BreedBase, Germinate, DeltaBreed, and GIGWA through BrAPI. It also 
  provides helper functions for accessing environmental data sources 
  including TerraClimate and the FAO HWSD v2 soil database.

keywords:
  - R
  - plant breeding
  - breeding management systems
  - BrAPI
  - phenotypic data
  - genotypic data
  - breeding informatics
  - EBS
  - BMS
  - BreedBase
  - Germinate
  - DeltaBreed
  - GIGWA
